# Third-party software

This project is MIT licensed. The image bundles the following, unmodified:

## mapshot

https://github.com/Palats/mapshot - Copyright Pierre Palatin, Apache License 2.0.

A pinned release of the `mapshot-linux` binary is vendored into the image and
does the rendering and serving. The Apache 2.0 licence text is at
https://github.com/Palats/mapshot/blob/master/LICENSE.

## steamCloudSaveDownloader (scsd)

https://github.com/pyscsd/steamCloudSaveDownloader - MIT License.

Installed from PyPI at image build time and used to pull saves from Steam
Cloud. Its request throttling is left untouched.

## cronsim

https://github.com/cuu508/cronsim - BSD 3-Clause License.

Installed from PyPI at image build time and used to work out when the next
render is due when `RENDER_CRON` is set.

## Factorio

https://factorio.com - Copyright Wube Software.

**No Factorio game files are in this image.** The client is downloaded at
runtime using the operator's own factorio.com account, and mods are downloaded
from the Factorio mod portal with the same credentials. Factorio is not
affiliated with this project.

